Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:39.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《黑客帝国》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:49.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(启动通话)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:52.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 一切都正常? - 我的工作还轮不到你插手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is everything in place? - You weren 't supposed to relieve me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:55.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是 不过总想来看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, but I felt like taking a shift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.01,0:00:58.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢上他了吧? 想来守着他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like him, don 't you? You like watching him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:01.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别胡说 - 我们要干掉他的 明白吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don 't be ridiculous. - We're gonna kill him. You understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.91,0:01:04.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思认为他就是救世主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus believes he is the One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.68,0:01:05.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.82,0:01:07.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的想法无关紧要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn 't matter what I believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:09.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是说 你不这样认为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don 't, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.69,0:01:11.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 听见那响声吗? - 听见什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you hear that? - Hear what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.06,0:01:13.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这条线路你敢担保没被动过手脚?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure this line is clean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.93,0:01:15.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放心 我当然敢担保{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, of course I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.26,0:01:17.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是挂掉为妙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I better go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.63,0:01:57.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不许动! 警察! - 双手抱头!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Freeze! Police! - Hands on your head!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:01:59.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,双手抱头! 快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it! Do it now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.61,0:02:09.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(剧场)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.78,0:02:10.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(城市旅馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:21.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,中队长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.13,0:02:23.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:27.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,中队长 你的职责早就给你特别明确过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant, you were given specific orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:29.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 这也是我的份内事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just doing my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.74,0:02:34.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说过可以随机应变的 怎么 当放屁吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You give me that "juris-my-dick-tion" crap, you can cram it up your ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.64,0:02:37.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你明确工作 那是为了保护你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The orders were for your protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:40.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么个小丫头 我们还是能对付的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we can handle one little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.95,0:02:47.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,何况我派了两队人马!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sent two units!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.95,0:02:49.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上就押她下来给你看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're bringing her down now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.56,0:02:52.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,中队长 你的人马已经全部阵亡了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Lieutenant, your men are already dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.29,0:03:23.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.57,0:03:28.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思 线路被侵入 侵入方式不明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus, the line was traced. I don't know how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.49,0:03:29.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经查明 他们切入了我们的设备缆线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. They cut the hard line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.13,0:03:32.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有时间了 赶快从另一出口逃出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no time. Get to another exit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:34.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那里有特警吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are there any agents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.20,0:03:34.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:36.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有种的就来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:38.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要掉以轻心 崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to focus, Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.37,0:03:40.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威尔森雷克街上有一部电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a phone at Wells and Lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:42.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定可以用得上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:45.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 行 - 行动!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. - Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:47.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这 不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:25.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,起来了 崔妮蒂 起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up, Trinity. Just get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:26.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,起...来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.69,0:06:14.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她已经脱身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She got out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:15.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.03,0:06:18.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,内线的情报相当准确{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The informant is real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.43,0:06:18.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.43,0:06:21.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们下一个目标 我们已经知道是谁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have the name of their next target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:22.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他名叫尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The name is Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.27,0:06:27.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,应该展开搜寻工作了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll need a search running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.14,0:06:30.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has already begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.30,0:06:42.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(搜寻...)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.01,0:06:42.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(全球搜寻...)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.73,0:06:46.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(警察秘密包围希思罗 莫费思机场脱险)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:54.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(...正在抓紧拘捕 )
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:15.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(不要再睡了 尼欧...)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:23.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(不要再睡了 尼欧...)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.83,0:07:25.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怪事!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.35,0:07:30.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(母体要把你...)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:33.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么鬼名堂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:41.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(跟着白兔走)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.35,0:07:43.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟着白兔走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Follow the white rabbit."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:48.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(跟着白兔走)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.69,0:07:55.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.09,0:07:57.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是乔艾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Choi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.98,0:08:12.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们迟到了两个小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're two hours late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:14.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 都怪她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. It's her fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.71,0:08:15.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钱带来了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.82,0:08:18.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两千整{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two grand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:20.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上就来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:28.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(幻像和模拟)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:40.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈利路亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hallelujah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:43.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的救星 哥们 我个人的上帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my savior. My own personal Jesus Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:45.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要坐牢的 如果你把它用在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get caught using that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.51,0:08:47.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道! 不会的 就算被抓到也没你的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. This never happened. You don't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.81,0:08:50.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 说得对 - 什么地方不舒服?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right. - Something wrong, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.87,0:08:52.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,脸色比平常苍白得多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look a little whiter than usual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.25,0:08:56.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的...电脑...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My computer, it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.42,0:09:04.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有过这种感觉没有? 就是你无法确定自己是醒着还是在做梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever have that feeling where you're not sure if you're awake or dreaming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.86,0:09:07.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,随时都会 嗑药后都这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the time. It's called mescaline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.10,0:09:10.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想腾云驾雾 就靠它了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only way to fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:13.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来你得发泄发泄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just sounds like you need to unplug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:16.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,休息一下吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get some R and R?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.71,0:09:20.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的高见呢 杜娇? 把他带出去一块玩玩好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think, Dujour? Should we take him with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.45,0:09:23.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没意见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:27.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 明天要上班{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I can't. I have work tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.62,0:09:28.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上什么班呀!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.05,0:09:31.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定会很开心的 听我的没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be fun. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:39.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:42.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听你的 我去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure. I'll go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:11.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:13.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道我的名字?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know that name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.40,0:10:16.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道的多了 何止名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know a lot about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.00,0:10:17.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.04,0:10:19.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:21.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:23.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,黑客崔妮蒂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Trinity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.48,0:10:26.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瘫痪国税局数据库的那位?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That cracked the IRS D-base?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.41,0:10:27.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那已经是很久前的事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:28.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.21,0:10:30.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:32.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just thought...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.12,0:10:35.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你是个男的呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you were a guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.49,0:10:36.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这号人的通病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most guys do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.19,0:10:40.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,入侵我电脑的也是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was you on my computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.03,0:10:42.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么进入的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.69,0:10:45.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我能告诉你的只有一句话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now, all I can tell you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:47.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的处境十分危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is that you're in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.07,0:10:50.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我把你叫到这个地方 就是为了提醒你 - 提醒什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I brought you here to warn you. - Of what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.07,0:10:52.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在监视你 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're watching you, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:54.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.37,0:10:55.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别急 听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please just listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.28,0:11:01.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你为何来到此地 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know why you're here, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.88,0:11:03.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你的一切所作所为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you've been doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.15,0:11:05.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你为什么睡不着觉...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know why you hardly sleep...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:09.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...为什么你一个人住 为什么你日以继夜地...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...why you live alone and why, night after night...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:11.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坐在电脑之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you sit at your computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.16,0:11:14.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是在找他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.43,0:11:18.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么知道的? 因为我有过同你一样的经历{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, because I was once looking for the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.03,0:11:21.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后来 是他找到了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when he found me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.71,0:11:24.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他告诉我 我要找的其实不是他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he told me I wasn't really looking for him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.74,0:11:27.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...而是一个答案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I was looking for an answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.14,0:11:31.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个无法解答的谜题 让我们惶惶不可终日 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the question that drives us, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.88,0:11:34.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个不解之谜把你带到了这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the question that brought you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.68,0:11:38.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的谜题是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the question...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:39.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也可以说 我的谜题是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...just as I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:42.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么是母体?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the Matrix?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.22,0:11:45.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,答案已经来了 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer is out there, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.32,0:11:48.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它正在找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.19,0:11:50.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它会找到你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it will find you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:53.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...如果你愿意让它找到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if you want it to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.87,0:12:00.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.01,0:12:02.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死! 该死!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.45,0:12:15.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不把公司放在眼里 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a problem with authority, Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.49,0:12:17.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自以为很特殊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You believe that you are special,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.27,0:12:19.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以不遵守公司的规定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the rules do not apply to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.75,0:12:25.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很显然 你错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously, you are mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.30,0:12:28.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,本公司是世界上顶尖软件公司之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is one of the top software companies in the world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.40,0:12:31.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...因为每一个员工都懂得 他们是公司整体的一部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because employees understand they are part of a whole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.07,0:12:36.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此 有一个员工出了问题 就意味着整个公司出了问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thus, if an employee has a problem, the company has a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.94,0:12:42.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能再拖了 给你两个选择 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The time has come to make a choice, Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:46.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,选择一 从今往后 准时坐在你的办公桌之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Either you choose to be at your desk on time from this day forth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:50.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,选择二 世界大的很 另请高就{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or you choose to find another job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.99,0:12:52.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的话还算好懂吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I make myself clear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:54.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 莱茵哈特先生 我全听明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Mr. Rhineheart. Perfectly clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.43,0:13:04.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,汤玛斯·安德森?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thomas Anderson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:08.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 就是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:19.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a nice day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.55,0:13:36.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.57,0:13:39.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 尼欧 知道我是谁吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Neo. Do you know who this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.17,0:13:46.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 莫费思 - 对 我一直在找你 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Morpheus. - Yes. I've been looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:49.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有东西想让你来看看 就是不知道是否太唐突{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don 't know if you're ready to see what I want to show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.81,0:13:53.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过你我现在已经没有时间来客套寒喧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But unfortunately, you and I have run out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.25,0:13:56.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们现在来抓你了 尼欧 后果不堪设想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming for you, and I don 't know what they're going to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.26,0:13:58.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁来抓我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's coming for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.79,0:14:00.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,站起来 自己看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand up and see for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:02.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么? 现在吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.90,0:14:03.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.16,0:14:05.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就现在!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:08.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别慌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:09.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,电梯那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The elevator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.71,0:14:15.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 妈的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:16.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.63,0:14:22.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么抓我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do they want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.41,0:14:26.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 别刨根问底了 快逃吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don 't know. If you don 't want to find out, get out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:26.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么逃?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:30.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我来给你指路 你必须一步不差才行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can guide you, but you must do exactly as I say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:31.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:33.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过道对面的那个工作间是空的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cubicle across from you is empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.33,0:14:38.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么办 如果他们... - 冲过去 马上!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But what if they... - Go. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.27,0:14:47.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先在这里避一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay here for just a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:57.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说跑时 你就从走道一路冲过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I tell you, go to the end of the row...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.82,0:14:59.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...那里是个办公室 就在大厅走廊的尽头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to the office at the end of the hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.02,0:15:02.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,腰尽量弯低些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay as low as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.82,0:15:05.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,预备 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.31,0:15:23.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 现在看外面 那里有个洗窗吊架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Now, outside there is a scaffold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.48,0:15:28.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你怎么知道的? - 以后再讨论吧 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you know this? - We don 't have time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:31.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你左边是窗子 走过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To your left there's a window. Go to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.15,0:15:35.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.52,0:15:38.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用吊架爬到屋顶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the scaffold to the roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:41.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行! 不行! 太疯狂了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way! No way! This is crazy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.39,0:15:43.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出这栋大楼有两套方案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are two ways out of this building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:47.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一是吊架 另一个就是束手就擒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One is that scaffold. The other is in their custody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.10,0:15:51.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪一套 都有危险 何去何从 你自己决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take a chance either way. I leave it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.91,0:15:56.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是在发疯吗! ?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is insane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:15:59.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会有这种事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is this happening to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:01.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办才好?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:04.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我 一个小人物 安分守己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm nobody. I didn't do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.32,0:16:06.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只剩死路一条?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.59,0:16:17.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:38.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 妈的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:45.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我过不去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.74,0:16:59.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.75,0:17:53.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看见了吧 我们已经注意你很久了 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you can see, we've had our eye on you for some time now, Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.89,0:17:57.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从档案上看 你好像有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems that you've been living...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:17:59.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...两重人格{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...two lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.30,0:18:03.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其一是：托玛斯·A·安德森...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In one life, you're Thomas A. Anderson...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.07,0:18:07.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...在一家著名的软件公司做程序设计员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...program writer for a respectable software company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.47,0:18:11.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有社会安全号码 交个人所得税{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a social security number. You pay your taxes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.18,0:18:13.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有 你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.05,0:18:18.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...还帮房东太太清理垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...help your landlady carry out her garbage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.19,0:18:24.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这另一个嘛 活在电脑里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other life is lived in computers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.82,0:18:27.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一名黑客 代号：外星人尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where you go by the hacker alias "Neo"...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:32.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...网络中的任何一项违法行为你都干过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and are guilty of virtually every computer crime we have a law for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.93,0:18:35.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两重人格中 一种嘛...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of these lives...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:37.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...前途光明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...has a future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.27,0:18:40.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,另一种嘛 就不是了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one of them does not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.98,0:18:47.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就直说了吧 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to be as forthcoming as I can be, Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.85,0:18:50.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请你来 是因为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.52,0:18:52.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我们需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because we need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:18:59.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,据我们所知 某一位人士已经找你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know that you've been contacted by a certain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.66,0:19:00.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,联系过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...individual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.89,0:19:06.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这位人士自称莫费思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man who calls himself "Morpheus."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.37,0:19:11.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说他好也罢、坏也罢 丝毫不会影响我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you think you know about this man is irrelevant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.60,0:19:14.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这里的许多当权者 都认为他是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is considered by many authorities...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.31,0:19:17.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...当今世界上最危险的生命体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to be the most dangerous man alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:21.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的同事 ...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My colleagues...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.75,0:19:24.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...认为 我同你坐在这里是浪费时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...believe that I am wasting my time with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.95,0:19:28.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是认为 你有走正路的愿望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I believe you wish to do the right thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:32.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会把这些档案记录统统销毁掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're willing to wipe the slate clean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:34.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...让你重新做人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...give you a fresh start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.19,0:19:38.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要做到有问必答 配合我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All we're asking in return is your cooperation...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.30,0:19:41.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...把那个恐怖分子捉拿归案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in bringing a known terrorist to justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.20,0:19:44.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.77,0:19:47.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你开的条件还真优厚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sounds like a really good deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.47,0:19:51.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我有一桩更好的买卖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I got a better one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.41,0:19:52.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样行不...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:55.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我向你伸中指{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I give you the finger...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.02,0:19:59.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你让我打电话找律师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you give me my phone call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.22,0:20:03.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...安德森先生...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Anderson...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.39,0:20:09.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你真让我失望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you disappoint me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.53,0:20:12.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这种盖世太保般的行径 是吓不倒我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't scare me with this gestapo crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.33,0:20:13.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我有辩护的权力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know my rights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:15.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要找律师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want my phone call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.10,0:20:18.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, Mr. Anderson...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:20.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...打电话有什么用...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what good is a phone call...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.77,0:20:24.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...如果你不能开口说话了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if you're unable to speak?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.18,0:21:00.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就靠你帮忙了 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to help us, Mr. Anderson...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.87,0:21:03.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...不管你愿意还是不愿意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whether you want to... ...or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.44,0:22:04.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的线路已经被窃听 所以我长话短说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This line is tapped, so I must be brief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.98,0:22:09.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们先逮到了你 但他们低估了你的重要性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got to you first, but they've underestimated how important you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.51,0:22:11.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是他们知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they knew what I know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.62,0:22:13.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你恐怕已经劫数难逃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you would probably be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.65,0:22:17.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么? 什么倒霉事要发生到我身上?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about? What is happening to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:23.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是救世主 尼欧 你找我 不过是这几年的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the One, Neo. You may have spent the last few years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.63,0:22:26.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...而我呢 我整个一生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...looking for me, but I've spent my entire life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.83,0:22:28.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...都在找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.90,0:22:32.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 你还想我们见见面吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, do you still want to meet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.07,0:22:35.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 想 - 那就到亚当街桥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Then go to the Adams Street bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.15,0:22:47.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,进来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.66,0:23:00.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这又为的是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.70,0:23:03.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,行门规矩 尼欧 为了保护自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's necessary, Neo. For our protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.55,0:23:04.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有谁要伤你们?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.77,0:23:05.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.17,0:23:08.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,脱掉你的衬衫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take off your shirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.18,0:23:08.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.21,0:23:10.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把车停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.55,0:23:15.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 警察可能就会赶来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, coppertop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.93,0:23:18.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有那份闲情 一口气回答个二十个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have time for 20 Questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.52,0:23:20.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们就是一句话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now, there's only one rule:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.19,0:23:22.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走我们的独木桥...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our way...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.82,0:23:23.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是走他们的康庄道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or the highway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.69,0:23:31.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.40,0:23:35.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 尼欧 你应该相信我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Neo, you have to trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.43,0:23:39.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么? - 因为你活在那个虚拟的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - Because you have been down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.87,0:23:41.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对它很清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.11,0:23:43.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虚拟世界只有一个结局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know exactly where it ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.88,0:23:48.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道那不是你想要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know that's not where you want to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.33,0:24:03.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾巴 开灯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apoc, lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.43,0:24:08.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人往后仰 把衬衫拉起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lie back. Lift up your shirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.47,0:24:11.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.64,0:24:12.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,电子虫捕捉机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're bugged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.48,0:24:21.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放松 别紧张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try and relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.25,0:24:29.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.55,0:24:31.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.29,0:24:34.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on the move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.03,0:24:37.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出来 你这个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.10,0:24:41.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 要给它溜掉了 - 不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're gonna lose it. - No, I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.63,0:24:42.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓到了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.67,0:24:52.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 那玩意是真的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ! That thing's real?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.08,0:25:28.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.72,0:25:34.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,进去之前 我有一个忠告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me give you one piece of advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.19,0:25:36.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请开诚布公{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be honest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.39,0:25:40.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他几乎无所不知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows more than you can imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.33,0:25:50.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们终于见面了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.20,0:25:53.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎你 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.47,0:25:56.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在猜 而且一定猜对了 对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you no doubt have guessed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.67,0:25:57.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我是莫费思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I am Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.98,0:26:00.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见到你 不胜荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an honor to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.91,0:26:01.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.61,0:26:03.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...万分荣幸的是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the honor is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.85,0:26:07.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来 这边 请坐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, come. Sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.43,0:26:24.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想像得出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I imagine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.47,0:26:27.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...此刻 你的感觉有点像爱丽丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that right now you're feeling a bit like Alice...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.97,0:26:31.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,梦游到了仙境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...tumbling down the rabbit hole?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.28,0:26:33.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有点像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.24,0:26:36.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是从你的眼睛里看出来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see it in your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.41,0:26:40.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从外表来看 你相信耳听为虚、眼见为实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the look of a man who accepts what he sees...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.95,0:26:43.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你们这种人都在期待有大彻大悟的一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because he's expecting to wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.62,0:26:47.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,讽刺的是 如此也算离真相不远了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ironically, this is not far from the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.96,0:26:50.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你相信命运吗 尼欧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe in fate, Neo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.69,0:26:51.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.10,0:26:53.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不信?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.26,0:26:56.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所谓命运 就是指身不由己 我不喜欢这种概念{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like the idea that I'm not in control of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.13,0:27:00.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我了解你所说的意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know exactly what you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.78,0:27:07.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我告诉你 为什么你会来这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you why you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.18,0:27:09.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你来 是因为你有某种悟性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.25,0:27:11.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你又无力解释你悟到的是什么东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you know, you can't explain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.35,0:27:13.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只是一种感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you feel it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.55,0:27:16.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这种感觉一直伴随着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You felt it your entire life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.12,0:27:21.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界 什么地方错了 尽管你 说不上个所以然 但是你知道它一定存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's wrong with the world. You don't know what, but it's there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.69,0:27:23.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无法获得答案 就像心头有根刺...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a splinter in your mind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.23,0:27:26.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...搅得你寝食不安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...driving you mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.00,0:27:29.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把你带到我这里来的就是这种感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is this feeling that has brought you to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.27,0:27:34.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道我这番话的意思吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what I'm talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.01,0:27:37.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,母体?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Matrix?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.74,0:27:41.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.95,0:27:43.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...它究竟是什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what it is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.32,0:27:48.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,母体 无处不在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Matrix is everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.42,0:27:50.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它就在我们周围{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is all around us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.39,0:27:52.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这个小小的房间里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even now, in this very room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.22,0:27:55.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你从窗户外可以看到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can see it when you look out your window...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.66,0:27:57.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在电视上也会看到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or when you turn on your television.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.36,0:28:00.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上班时感觉到它的存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can feel it when you go to work...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.43,0:28:04.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当你上教堂...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when you go to church...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.57,0:28:06.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...或纳税时也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when you pay your taxes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.74,0:28:10.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它就是那个遮住你双眼的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the world that has been pulled over your eyes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.91,0:28:12.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让你对真相一无所知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to blind you from the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.71,0:28:16.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么真相?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.25,0:28:22.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真相就是 你是个奴隶 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you are a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.29,0:28:25.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,同其他任何人一样 每个人呱呱落地后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like everyone else, you were born into bondage...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.86,0:28:30.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就活在一个没有知觉的牢狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...born into a prison that you cannot smell or taste or touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.83,0:28:32.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当一辈子囚犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A prison...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.36,0:28:34.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个思想被禁锢的囚犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.47,0:28:42.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很不幸 我无法告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, no one can be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.14,0:28:45.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么是母体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...told what the Matrix is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.05,0:28:50.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须自己体会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to see it for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.39,0:29:02.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的最后机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your last chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.86,0:29:05.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,之后就没回头路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After this, there is no turning back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.73,0:29:07.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你吞下蓝色药丸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take the blue pill...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.50,0:29:10.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,故事到此结束 你会在床上醒来 继续去彷徨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the story ends, you wake up in your bed and believe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.80,0:29:12.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不分东南西北{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whatever you want to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.84,0:29:14.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你吞下红色药丸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take the red pill...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.37,0:29:16.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就留在了这个故事中的仙境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you stay in Wonderland...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.91,0:29:19.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会带你去看个明白 爱丽丝看到的兔子窝究竟有多深{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I show you how deep the rabbit hole goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.49,0:29:30.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记住...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.52,0:29:34.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我要告诉你的只有一样东西 真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...all I'm offering is the truth. Nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.91,0:29:50.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,随我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.71,0:29:54.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾巴 上线了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apoc, are we on-line?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.68,0:29:56.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.42,0:30:01.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是在同我们作对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time is always against us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.82,0:30:03.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请在这里坐下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please take a seat there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.51,0:30:23.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也这么做过?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.34,0:30:29.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你吞下去的药丸 是一套追踪程序{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pill you took is part of a trace program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.15,0:30:34.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它中断你的载体信号 这样我们就能准确定点你的空间位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It disrupts your carrier signals so we can pinpoint your location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.12,0:30:36.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.89,0:30:39.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它的意思就是 把安全带系起来 伙计...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means buckle your seat belt, Dorothy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.39,0:30:40.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...因为我们就要...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because Kansas...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.92,0:30:41.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...脱胎换骨了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is going bye-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.93,0:31:21.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.31,0:31:36.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你做过这样的梦没有 尼欧 就是你觉得它不是梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever had a dream, Neo, that you were so sure was real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.88,0:31:40.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果在这种梦中你无法醒过来 那又会怎么样?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if you were unable to wake from that dream?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.65,0:31:43.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么去知道自己是生活在梦魇世界里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How would you know the difference between the dream world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.82,0:31:45.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是真实世界中?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and the real world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.89,0:31:48.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.33,0:31:49.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.93,0:31:51.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能是真的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.43,0:31:56.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,进入复制程序{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going into replication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.70,0:31:57.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apoc{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.13,0:31:58.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,程序没有被执行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.64,0:31:59.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好冷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.07,0:32:01.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好冷啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.31,0:32:07.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坦克 立即给信号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tank, we'll need a signal soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.55,0:32:09.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,心脏衰竭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a fibrillation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.65,0:32:11.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾巴 定位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apoc, location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.42,0:32:12.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经接近目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Targeting almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.25,0:32:17.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的心跳停止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going into arrest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.82,0:32:18.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,锁定 我已经控制住他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock. I got him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.89,0:32:19.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马上 坦克 马上开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Tank, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.58,0:35:18.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.05,0:35:20.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...来到真实世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to the real world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.38,0:35:24.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,成功了 崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've done it, Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.42,0:35:26.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,终于找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.22,0:35:29.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 但愿你是对的 - 我用不着"但愿"两字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I hope you're right. - I don't have to hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.59,0:35:31.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.33,0:35:37.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我死了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.87,0:35:40.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正好相反{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Far from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.05,0:35:55.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他身上我们还有很多工作要做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He still needs a lot of work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.02,0:35:58.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是在干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.29,0:36:00.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的肌肉全部萎缩了 我们正在重建{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your muscles atrophied. We're rebuilding them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.16,0:36:02.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我的眼睛好痛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do my eyes hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.36,0:36:05.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你从来没用过它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've never used them before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.20,0:36:10.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别急 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rest, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.30,0:36:11.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会知道一切真相的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answers are coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.57,0:37:28.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思 我身上发生什么事了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus, what's happened to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.32,0:37:30.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么地方?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.11,0:37:32.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在问"何时" 要比问"什么"重要的多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More important than "what" is "when."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.58,0:37:34.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是"何时"?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.51,0:37:36.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还以为今年是 1999 年吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You believe it's the year 1999...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.78,0:37:39.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上现在已经快 2199 年了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when in fact, it's closer to 2199.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.15,0:37:42.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法告诉你具体的日期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you exactly what year it is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.19,0:37:44.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...因为我们自己也不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because we honestly don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.29,0:37:48.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且越解释 越糊涂 不说了 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing I can say that will explain it for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.40,0:37:49.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.90,0:37:51.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.67,0:37:53.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的战舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.77,0:37:56.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼布加尼撒号 气垫飞行战舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Nebuchadnezzar. It's a hovercraft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.47,0:38:01.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是主舱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the main deck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.19,0:38:08.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是核心区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the core...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.81,0:38:10.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(尼布加尼撒  美国制造  2006年)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.78,0:38:14.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从这里 我们向母体发出 黑客广播讯号 进行干扰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where we broadcast our pirate signal and hack into the Matrix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.92,0:38:21.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的同伴 大多数你都已认识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of my crew you already know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.10,0:38:27.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是艾巴.{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Apoc...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.24,0:38:29.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...苏薇琪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Switch...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.20,0:38:32.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...他是塞佛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and Cypher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.61,0:38:36.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还不认识的那个家伙是坦克 还有他哥哥道瑟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ones you don't know: Tank and his big brother, Dozer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.18,0:38:39.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,站在你后面的那个小不点叫耗子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The little one behind you is Mouse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.98,0:38:47.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是想知道母体是什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted to know what the Matrix is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.26,0:38:49.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.48,0:39:12.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张 尽力放松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.95,0:39:18.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉上会有点怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will feel a little weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.35,0:39:23.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(辅助磁盘机)
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.80,0:39:31.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.30,0:39:34.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...就是宏控架构{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is the Construct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.43,0:39:36.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它是我们的装载程序{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our loading program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.77,0:39:39.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以载入任何东西 比如服装{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can load anything, from clothing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.51,0:39:40.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,器材{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to equipment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.21,0:39:42.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...weapons...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.14,0:39:44.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,模拟训练{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...training simulations...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.35,0:39:47.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要的任何东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...anything we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.72,0:39:53.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在就是在电脑运行的程序里面吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now we're inside a computer program?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.35,0:39:55.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有那么难以置信吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it really so hard to believe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.82,0:39:58.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的衣服已经被换掉 手臂上的插孔也没有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your clothes are different. The plugs in your body are gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.59,0:40:01.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发型也换了个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your hair has changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.16,0:40:05.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在这个人 我们称之为"残留自我影像"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your appearance now is what we call "residual self-image."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.20,0:40:08.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在虚拟世界的投影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the mental projection of your digital self.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.71,0:40:15.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是真的吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.08,0:40:17.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫"真"?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is "real"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.01,0:40:20.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎样给"真"下定义?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you define "real"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.60,0:40:22.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果说是你能感觉到的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're talking about what you can feel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.68,0:40:25.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你能闻到的气味 你能尝到味道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what you can smell, taste and see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.32,0:40:29.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么这个"真"就是 你大脑作出反应的电子信号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...then "real" is simply electrical signals interpreted by your brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.39,0:40:35.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你所知道的世界就是这样一个世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the world that you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.10,0:40:41.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是20世纪末的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world as it was at the end of the 20th century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.64,0:40:47.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在把它看成是"神经交互模拟"的一部份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It exists now only as part of a neural-interactive simulation...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.24,0:40:48.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...称之为母体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that we call the Matrix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.05,0:40:55.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你生活的那个世界是个梦境世界 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been living in a dream world, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.85,0:40:57.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你看到的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.22,0:41:00.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,才是真实的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as it exists today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.10,0:41:16.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到真实的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to "the desert...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.87,0:41:18.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...戈壁荒漠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of the real."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.88,0:41:24.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只掌握到少得可怜的信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have only bits and pieces of information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.44,0:41:28.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们知道在21世纪初的某个时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what we know for certain is that in the early 21 st century...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.48,0:41:31.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...全世界的人都欢聚一堂 庆祝自己的伟大成就{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...all of mankind was united in celebration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.02,0:41:37.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们自我陶醉 因为我们发明了"AI"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We marveled at our own magnificence as we gave birth to AI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.52,0:41:38.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"AI"?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}AI?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.76,0:41:41.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说"人工智能"吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean artificial intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.33,0:41:45.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一种卓绝的意识 赋予了机器质的改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A singular consciousness that spawned an entire race of machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.63,0:41:50.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道是谁首先发动了战争 是我们还是机器?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know who struck first, us or them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.47,0:41:53.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们知道 当机器只能依靠太阳能的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we know that it was us that scorched the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.41,0:41:57.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我们把天空遮掩了起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were dependent on solar power...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.78,0:42:01.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,据信 如果没有太阳这一巨大的能源库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and it was believed that they would be unable to survive...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.48,0:42:05.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,机器将是一堆毫无用处的废铜烂铁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...without an energy source as abundant as the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.22,0:42:10.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,纵览人类历史 我们的生活根本离不开机器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throughout human history, we have been dependent on machines to survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.59,0:42:15.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,命运 看上去 真的很讽刺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fate, it seems, is not without a sense of irony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.03,0:42:23.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人体产生的生物电大于一百二十伏特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The human body generates more bioelectricity than a 120-volt battery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.60,0:42:27.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,体热超过两万五千个热量单位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And over 25,000 BTUs of body heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.68,0:42:31.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用核融合的方式进行聚合{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Combined with a form of fusion...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.21,0:42:37.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...机器就可以找到它们所需的全部能源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the machines had found all the energy they would ever need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.15,0:42:44.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们开发出一望无际的场地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are fields, Neo, endless fields...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.16,0:42:48.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人类不再从娘胎出生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where human beings are no longer born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.10,0:42:50.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,像庄稼一样被种出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are grown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.94,0:42:59.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我长久长久以来 一直不相信这种说法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the longest time, I wouldn't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.77,0:43:02.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然而我亲眼目睹了栽培区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I saw the fields with my own eyes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.84,0:43:05.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...看着它们液化尸体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...watched them liquefy the dead...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.68,0:43:09.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...通过静脉输入活人体内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so they could be fed intravenously to the living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.55,0:43:13.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我站在那里 看着这活生生的 恐怖的、精确的、制造过程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And standing there, facing the pure, horrifying precision...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.02,0:43:16.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我终于明白 原来 真相 并无奥秘可言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I came to realize the obviousness of the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.59,0:43:21.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么是母体?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the Matrix?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.60,0:43:23.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,控制{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.03,0:43:28.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,母体就是电脑操纵的梦境世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Matrix is a computer-generated dream world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.17,0:43:32.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它的建立就是为了控制人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...built to keep us under control...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.44,0:43:36.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以便将人变成...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in order to change a human being...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.24,0:43:38.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...into this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.75,0:43:40.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.55,0:43:44.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.52,0:43:45.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.29,0:43:50.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 它不是很易理解 尼欧 但是 事实的确如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't say it would be easy, Neo. I just said it would be the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.12,0:43:51.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.99,0:43:54.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.93,0:43:56.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我出去! 我要出去!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me out! I want out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.77,0:44:01.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 冷静 尼欧 冷静 - 把这些东西都给我拔掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Easy, Neo. Easy. - Get this thing out of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.64,0:44:03.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把这些东西都给我拔掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get this thing out of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.17,0:44:06.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别碰我!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.91,0:44:08.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们给我走开!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay away from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.98,0:44:10.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.14,0:44:12.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不信!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.56,0:44:13.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不信!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.35,0:44:16.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 当心他会憋住 - 深呼吸 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's gonna pop. - Breathe, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.02,0:44:17.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快呼吸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.27,0:44:38.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我回不去了 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't go back, can I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.25,0:44:39.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.14,0:44:42.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过 如果可以的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you could...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.18,0:44:44.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是否真的想回去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...would you really want to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.21,0:44:48.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我向你道歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe you an apology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.18,0:44:50.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有一条规矩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a rule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.02,0:44:54.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不能解放成年人的心灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We never free a mind once it's reached a certain age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.59,0:44:55.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太危险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.22,0:44:57.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,根深蒂固的成见很难被抛弃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mind has trouble letting go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.16,0:45:00.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我明知故犯 所以 我向你道歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen it before, and I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.46,0:45:03.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我之所以这么做 是因为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did what I did because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.30,0:45:05.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.21,0:45:18.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当母体成形时 有一个人诞生了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the Matrix was first built, there was a man born inside...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.71,0:45:22.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他有随心所欲改变一切的能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who had the ability to change whatever he wanted...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.98,0:45:25.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...使母体的运行尽可能按照他的意愿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to remake the Matrix as he saw fit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.59,0:45:31.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们当中的第一人就是他解放的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was he who freed the first of us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.99,0:45:33.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他给我们讲述真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...taught us the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.06,0:45:38.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要母体存在一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as the Matrix exists...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.40,0:45:40.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人类就无法自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the human race will never be free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.70,0:45:46.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他死后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After he died...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.07,0:45:49.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先知预言他会回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the Oracle prophesied his return...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.28,0:45:53.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的到来 就是来领导我们摧毁母体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and that his coming would hail the destruction of the Matrix...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.71,0:45:55.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,结束战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...end the war...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.75,0:45:57.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给人类带来自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...bring freedom to our people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.32,0:46:03.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为什么我们这些人 会用一生的精力在母体中搜索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is why there are those of us who spent our lives searching the Matrix...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.29,0:46:04.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望找到他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Iooking for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.29,0:46:09.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我之所以这么做是因为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did what I did because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.06,0:46:13.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信我已经找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I believe that search is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.24,0:46:19.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好好休息一下吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get some rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.27,0:46:22.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要好好休息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.98,0:46:25.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要休息?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.53,0:46:30.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为你的训练{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.33,0:46:50.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 没睡觉?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning. Did you sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.96,0:46:52.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证你今晚一定睡得很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.50,0:46:54.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我敢担保{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guarantee it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.60,0:46:57.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是坦克 是你的接线员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Tank. I'll be your operator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.94,0:47:00.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没有 那个那个... - 插孔? 没...有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't have any... - Holes? Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.05,0:47:06.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我和我兄弟道瑟 是百分之百的纯种人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and my brother, Dozer, are 100?o pure, old-fashioned, homegrown human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.25,0:47:07.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就在这里出生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Born free right here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.08,0:47:09.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是真实世界的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in the real world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.62,0:47:11.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,纯种的锡安子孙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genuine child of Zion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.15,0:47:14.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 锡安? - 要是战争结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Zion? - Lf the war was over tomorrow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.79,0:47:16.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,锡安就热闹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Zion's where the party would be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.69,0:47:18.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,锡安是一座城市?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.29,0:47:21.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最后一座人类城市 我们的唯一圣地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last human city. The only place we have left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.03,0:47:24.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.00,0:47:27.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很深的地底下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deep underground...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.30,0:47:29.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,靠近地核 一个还很温暖的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...near the Earth's core, where it's still warm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.04,0:47:32.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你都长这么大了 应该看见过的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You live long enough, you might see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.21,0:47:40.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须告诉你 我很急切地想见识你的能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn! I gotta tell you, I'm excited to see what you're capable of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.31,0:47:42.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是否真的像莫费思说的那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if Morpheus is right and all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.51,0:47:45.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不该谈这档事 不过...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not supposed to talk about this, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.55,0:47:46.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能够...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if you are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.91,0:47:49.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就真令人兴奋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it's a very exciting time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.16,0:47:53.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天会很忙 我们快开始吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a lot to do. We gotta get to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.73,0:48:00.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 我们要先执行这套程序{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're supposed to start with these programs first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.63,0:48:03.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是最没劲的垃圾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's major boring shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.01,0:48:07.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来做点有趣的事吧 这个如何?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do something more fun. How about...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.51,0:48:10.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来做格斗训练{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...combat training?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.28,0:48:17.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,柔道?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Jujitsu"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.65,0:48:20.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要学习柔道?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to learn jujitsu?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.63,0:48:32.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么鬼名堂!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.16,0:48:35.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"嘿 马安济 我看他蛮喜欢的"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Hey, Mikey, I think he likes it."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.80,0:48:37.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再来吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about some more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.30,0:48:38.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好呀 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.87,0:48:41.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好呀 来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.81,0:48:43.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(跆拳道)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.45,0:48:45.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(醉拳)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.12,0:48:55.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他行吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.16,0:48:59.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有多少学多少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten hours straight. He's a machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.67,0:49:10.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,功夫我会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know kung fu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.90,0:49:12.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就来露一手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.51,0:49:16.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一套拳击训练课目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a sparring program...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.47,0:49:19.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,与母体里的那套真实拳路相似{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...similar to the programmed reality of the Matrix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.48,0:49:21.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,基本规则都一样 如重心的应用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has the same basic rules. Like gravity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.01,0:49:25.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须知道的是 这些规则和电脑系统里的没有区别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These rules are no different than those of a computer system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.12,0:49:27.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有些可以改而用之{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of them can be bent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.85,0:49:28.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有些...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Others...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.89,0:49:30.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...可以破而用之{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...can be broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.49,0:49:31.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,懂了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.22,0:49:34.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来 攻击我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then hit me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.63,0:49:35.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...凭你的本事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.07,0:50:15.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.57,0:50:17.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,适应...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Adaptation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.00,0:50:19.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...临场应变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Improvisation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.54,0:50:20.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 你的弱点...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But your weakness...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.10,0:50:22.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...不在技术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is not your technique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.41,0:50:30.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思在和尼欧过招{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus is fighting Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.79,0:51:45.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是怎么打倒你的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did I beat you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.59,0:51:52.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你动作比我快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.16,0:51:54.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.90,0:51:57.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我比你强或者比你快...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...my being stronger or faster...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.67,0:52:01.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...是因为我的肌肉更发达?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...has anything to do with my muscles in this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.31,0:52:07.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里需要呼吸吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you're breathing air?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.72,0:52:21.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再来!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.34,0:52:35.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪! 他快起来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ, he's fast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.04,0:52:38.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的运动神经异于常人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His neuro-kinetics are way above normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.75,0:52:45.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还在等什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.21,0:52:47.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的动作还要更快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're faster than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.62,0:52:51.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要怀疑自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.09,0:52:53.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要尽力发挥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.13,0:53:06.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来呀 别犹豫 直接打我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Stop trying to hit me, and hit me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.85,0:53:17.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.15,0:53:22.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你要干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you're trying to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.88,0:53:26.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要解放你的思想 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to free your mind, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.39,0:53:28.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我只能开启那道门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I can only show you the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.06,0:53:30.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你得自己走过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to walk through it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.23,0:53:35.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坦克 载入跳跃程序{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tank, load the jump program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.66,0:53:40.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(载入)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.44,0:53:49.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丢掉一切私心杂念 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to let it all go, Neo. Fear...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.74,0:53:53.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,丢掉恐惧、犹豫和怀疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...doubt and disbelief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.65,0:53:56.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,解放你的思想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Free your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.43,0:54:14.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okey-dokey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.27,0:54:17.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,解放我的思想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Free my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.58,0:54:18.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他行吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if he makes it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.04,0:54:22.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没有人第一次就成功 - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No one's ever made their first jump. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.31,0:54:25.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不过他如果成功呢? - 不会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But what if he does? - He won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.65,0:54:27.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.75,0:54:28.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.28,0:54:31.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 解放思想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem. Free my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.22,0:54:34.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,解放思想 没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Free my mind. No problem. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.34,0:54:56.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这代表什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.38,0:54:58.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不代表什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't mean anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.88,0:55:01.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第一次每个人都会跌倒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody falls the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.88,0:55:03.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对吗 崔妮蒂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, Trin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.50,0:55:27.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我以为这是假的 - 你的大脑认为是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought it wasn't real. - Your mind makes it real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.71,0:55:31.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你在母体中被杀死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're killed in the Matrix...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.08,0:55:33.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也会死在这里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you die here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.81,0:55:36.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,灵魂已出窍 躯壳何用之有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The body cannot live without the mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.81,0:56:10.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你从来都没送过晚餐给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember you ever bringing me dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.22,0:56:16.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他与众不同 对吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is something about him, isn't there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.69,0:56:18.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别说你也相信了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a believer now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.32,0:56:20.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我总有点奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I keep wondering...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.76,0:56:24.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果莫费思这么相信自己的眼光 为什么不带他去见见先知?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if Morpheus is so sure, why not take him to see the Oracle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.33,0:56:28.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时机一成熟 莫费思就会带他去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus will take him when he's ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.11,0:56:39.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,母体是一个系统 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Matrix is a system, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.38,0:56:42.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个系统就是我们的敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That system is our enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.32,0:56:45.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 当你陷在这个系统里面时 你能看见什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when you're inside, what do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.88,0:56:49.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看见的是上班族、教师、律师、工匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Businessmen, teachers, lawyers, carpenters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.12,0:56:52.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些人思想狭窄 都是我们拯救的对象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The very minds of the people we are trying to save.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.99,0:56:56.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们不动手 他们就是这个系统的一部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But until we do, these people are a part of that system...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.19,0:56:58.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...也就是说 他们是我们的敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and that makes them our enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.46,0:56:59.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须懂得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to understand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.73,0:57:03.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些人中的大多数都不会愿意你去解救他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...most of these people are not ready to be unplugged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.34,0:57:04.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,更有甚者 许多人对此麻木不仁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And many of them are so inert...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.17,0:57:07.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死心塌地地依赖着这个系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so hopelessly dependent on the system... ...so hopelessly dependent on the system...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.81,0:57:10.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且还会誓死捍卫它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that they will fight to protect it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.04,0:57:15.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是在听我说呢 尼欧 还是魂已给红衣女郎给勾去了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you listening to me or looking at the woman in the red dress?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.88,0:57:16.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.90,0:57:17.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那再看一眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.98,0:57:20.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,定身!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.19,0:57:28.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这...这是母体? - 不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This isn't the Matrix? - No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.13,0:57:33.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是另一套训练课程 它告诉你一个道理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's another training program designed to teach you one thing:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.57,0:57:37.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不是我们的一员 你就会与他们为伍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you are not one of us, you are one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.14,0:57:40.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们是什么? - 感知程序{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are they? - Sentient programs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.07,0:57:45.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们能在任何软件中自由进出 而不须更改他们的系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can move in and out of any software still hardwired to their system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.78,0:57:49.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是说 任何人 你不去把他的插孔拔掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means that anyone we haven't unplugged...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.41,0:57:50.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是一个潜在的特警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is potentially an agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.78,0:57:53.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在母体里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside the Matrix...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.22,0:57:55.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以说 每个人都是特警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they are everyone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.19,0:57:57.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也可以说 每个人都不是特警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and they are no one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.16,0:58:01.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要想不被他们杀死 必须敬而远之{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have survived by hiding and running from them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.56,0:58:03.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们每个人都是守卫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but they are the gatekeepers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.24,0:58:06.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把守每个门户 掌握每个关键 就是说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're guarding all the doors and holding all the keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.73,0:58:09.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迟早 总有一个人迟早会把他们打败{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sooner or later, someone will have to fight them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.00,0:58:11.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迟早...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.20,0:58:12.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想骗你 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't lie to you, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.10,0:58:17.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们中凡是遇到特警的 无论男女 都丧命了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every single man or woman who has fought an agent has died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.18,0:58:20.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是他们就打不过你 你会赢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But where they have failed, you will succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.68,0:58:21.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.81,0:58:24.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看见过特警一拳打穿水泥墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen an agent punch through a concrete wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.55,0:58:28.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们乱枪扫射 却一颗子弹都打不中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men have emptied entire clips at them and hit nothing but air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.39,0:58:33.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的力度和速度来自于 一个按规则建立起来的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet their strength and speed are still based in a world built on rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.26,0:58:34.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正因为如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.66,0:58:38.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们永远都强不过你或快过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they will never be as strong or as fast as you can be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.33,0:58:44.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这番话的意思是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you telling me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.94,0:58:46.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的速度可以快过子弹?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I can dodge bullets?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.37,0:58:49.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.24,0:58:53.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的这番话的意思就是 只要你有了准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to tell you that when you're ready...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.04,0:58:55.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就不必避子弹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you won't have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.98,0:59:00.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.64,0:59:21.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,锡安给过我们预警没有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did Zion send the warning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.24,0:59:22.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 是另一艘战舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, another ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.34,0:59:26.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.94,0:59:28.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乌贼追上来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Squiddy's sweeping in quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.01,0:59:29.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乌贼?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Squiddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.05,0:59:33.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太空敌哨 一台电子乌贼 只有一种功能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A sentinel. A killing machine designed for one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.48,0:59:34.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搜索和摧毁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search and destroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.02,0:59:37.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把它送到那边去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set her down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.58,1:00:00.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们情况怎么样 坦克?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are we doing, Tank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.19,1:00:09.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,切断电源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power off-line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.19,1:00:14.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,启动 EMP...准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}EMP armed... and ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.38,1:00:16.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- EMP? - 就是电磁脉冲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- EMP? - Electromagnetic pulse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.79,1:00:19.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它可以在脉冲爆发半径内 瘫痪所有的电子系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disables any electrical system in the blast radius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.96,1:00:22.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们唯一对付人工智能机器的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only weapon we have against the machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.94,1:00:28.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.01,1:00:31.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,旧日的供水系统和废水系统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their old service and waste systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.61,1:00:33.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下水道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sewers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.64,1:00:36.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里原来都是城市 下水道有几百里长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There used to be cities that spanned hundreds of miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.91,1:00:38.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在遗留下来的就是这些下水道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now these sewers are all that's left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.05,1:00:40.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,安静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.65,1:01:22.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow Neo{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.23,1:01:26.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把我吓得个半死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You scared the bejesus out of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.46,1:01:29.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 对不起 - 算了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry. - It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.33,1:01:33.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.40,1:01:34.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,母体? 正是!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Matrix?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.21,1:01:41.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你总是用解码的方式查看它? - 是呀 必须这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you always look at it encoded? - Well, you have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.58,1:01:44.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,图像翻译软件为宏控架构作出解释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The image translators work for the construct program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.98,1:01:48.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是母体的图像实在太多了 充分解码是不可能的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's way too much information to decode the Matrix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.38,1:01:51.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要会看它 在我眼里 它们就不是解码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get used to it. I don't even see the code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.75,1:01:54.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看 这个人的头发是棕色 那个是黑褐色 那个是红色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I see is blonde, brunette, redhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.39,1:01:57.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.09,1:01:59.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喝一杯吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...want a drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.39,1:02:00.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.03,1:02:05.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.33,1:02:07.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你现在在想什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I know what you're thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.17,1:02:10.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为现在我想的也是同样的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because right now I'm thinking the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.61,1:02:13.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然这个问题是我来到这里就一直在想的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I've been thinking it ever since I got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.72,1:02:18.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 为什么当初我没有拿蓝色药丸?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, oh, why didn't I take the blue pill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.23,1:02:33.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这马尿水还好喝吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good shit, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.49,1:02:34.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,道瑟酿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dozer makes it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.13,1:02:36.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喝这酒有两大好处：{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good for two things:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.53,1:02:39.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,降低引擎润滑指数和杀死脑细胞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Degreasing engines and killing brain cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.67,1:02:42.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喝了我的酒 那我要问问题了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So can I ask you something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.87,1:02:47.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他跟你说过没有 他为什么这么做?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he tell you why he did it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.14,1:02:51.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是 为什么你会来到这里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why you're here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.65,1:02:57.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的上帝!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.59,1:03:00.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,思想工作真做到家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a mind job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.92,1:03:04.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说 你来到这里是为了拯救世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're here to save the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.23,1:03:08.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说 怎么不叫人把牙笑掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say to something like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.47,1:03:14.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有一个小小的忠告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little piece of advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.67,1:03:18.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦遭遇特警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see an agent...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.41,1:03:20.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的惯技就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you do what we do:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.04,1:03:22.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,溜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.91,1:03:24.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,溜之才会大吉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You run your ass off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.92,1:03:33.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你的酒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.33,1:03:39.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做个好梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.50,1:03:46.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的交易作成了吗 雷根先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we have a deal, Mr. Reagan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.60,1:03:48.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.20,1:03:52.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这块肉并不存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I know this steak doesn't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.61,1:03:56.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 当我把它送入嘴里时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that when I put it in my mouth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.58,1:03:59.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,母体就告诉我的脑子说这东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the Matrix is telling my brain that it is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.98,1:04:01.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,汁既多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...juicy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.41,1:04:03.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,又可口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and delicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.02,1:04:07.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,九年后的今天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After nine years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.32,1:04:09.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道我觉悟到什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you know what I realize?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.70,1:04:18.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无知就是幸福{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ignorance is bliss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.94,1:04:25.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那 我们的交易就这么定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we have a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.31,1:04:30.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我什么也不想留在记忆里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to remember nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.48,1:04:31.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,忘掉一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.81,1:04:32.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,懂吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.02,1:04:38.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想做个有钱人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want to be rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.19,1:04:42.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是 我想做一个有作为的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, someone important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.36,1:04:45.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比如说当演员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like an actor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.73,1:04:49.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你想做什么 雷根先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you want, Mr. Reagan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.07,1:04:53.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.93,1:04:56.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把我的身体弄回发电厂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get my body back in a power plant...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.74,1:04:58.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我重返母体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...reinsert me into the Matrix...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.84,1:05:00.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要的东西我都给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'll get you what you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.32,1:05:02.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要进入锡安主机的登录密码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Access codes to the Zion mainframe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.74,1:05:04.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿不出来 告诉过你我无法接触密码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I told you, I don't know them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.88,1:05:09.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以把知道登录密码的人交给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can get you the man who does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.58,1:05:12.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就交出莫费思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.56,1:05:26.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的在这里 伙计 冠军早餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go, buddy. Breakfast of champions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.30,1:05:30.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闭着眼睛吃吧 滑不溜俅的像生鸡蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close your eyes, it feels like you're eating runny eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.24,1:05:31.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还不如说像鼻涕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or a bowl of snot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.54,1:05:34.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道这东西让我想起什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what it reminds me of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.94,1:05:38.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"美味膨化麦片" 你拿它当过早餐没有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tastee Wheat. Did you ever eat Tastee Wheat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.94,1:05:40.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他没吃过 严格地说 你也没吃过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but technically, neither did you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.88,1:05:42.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要说的就是这个 就是这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly my point. Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.18,1:05:44.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为 现在你一定会奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you have to wonder...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.78,1:05:48.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,机器怎么会知道膨化麦片 吃起来是个什么味道?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...how do the machines really know what Tastee Wheat tasted like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.35,1:05:49.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许它们搞错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they got it wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.99,1:05:53.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我认为膨化麦片吃起来实际上味道像...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe what I think Tastee Wheat tasted like actually tasted like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.39,1:05:55.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,金枪鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...oatmeal or tuna fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.89,1:05:58.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是说许多事情都会让你感到奇怪 就说鸡肉吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That makes you wonder. Take chicken, for example.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.96,1:06:01.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许它们把鸡肉的味道分解出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they didn't know what to make it taste like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.23,1:06:03.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些成分其他食品里都有 所以鸡肉等于一切食品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which is why it tastes like everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.54,1:06:05.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许它们... - 住嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And maybe they... - Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.94,1:06:08.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是单细胞的蛋白质...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a single-celled protein...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.64,1:06:11.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,融合了综合性氨基础类、维他命和矿物质{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...combined with synthetic aminos, vitamins and minerals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.91,1:06:13.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,身体需要的它都有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything the body needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.41,1:06:16.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁说身体需要的它都有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't have everything the body needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.08,1:06:22.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说 我懂了 你已经通过了逃避特警的训练课程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand you've run through the agent training program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.22,1:06:25.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道我是谁吗? 那程序是我写的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I wrote that program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.49,1:06:26.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,又来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here it comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.09,1:06:29.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你觉得她怎么样? - 谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you think of her? - Of who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.43,1:06:32.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个红衣女郎 她是我设计的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The woman in the red dress. I designed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.76,1:06:35.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她么 她不太喜欢说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She doesn't talk very much...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.69,1:06:39.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想见见她 我可以安排一个非常私人的约会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but if you'd like to meet her, I can arrange a more personal milieu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.81,1:06:41.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,活像个皮条客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The digital pimp hard at work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.64,1:06:43.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别管这些伪君子 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pay no attention to these hypocrites, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.24,1:06:47.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,否认人有冲动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To deny our own impulses...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.31,1:06:50.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是否认作为人的基本条件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is to deny the very thing that makes us human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.35,1:06:53.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,道瑟 你吃完后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dozer, when you're done...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.95,1:06:55.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把战舰升到广播高度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...bring the ship up to broadcast depth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.05,1:06:57.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要进去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.12,1:06:59.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,带尼欧去见她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm taking Neo to see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.89,1:07:04.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.76,1:07:06.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Oracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.47,1:07:14.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家注意了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, please observe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.37,1:07:17.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请系好安全带 请勿吸烟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the "fasten seat belt" and "no smoking" signs are on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.61,1:07:20.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坐好 祝你旅途愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit back and enjoy your flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.43,1:07:47.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.12,1:08:03.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一小时后回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be back in an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.07,1:08:19.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真不可思议...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.24,1:08:21.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是不是?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.18,1:08:27.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 天哪! - 什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- God! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.71,1:08:29.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那家餐馆我常去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to eat there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.35,1:08:32.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,面条做得非常好吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really good noodles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.79,1:08:40.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一辈子都会保存这些记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have these memories from my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.73,1:08:44.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不会再有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of them happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.28,1:08:46.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.54,1:08:48.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,意思就是 母体不知道你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That the Matrix cannot tell you who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.31,1:08:50.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先知却可以?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But an oracle can?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.98,1:08:52.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是区别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.69,1:08:58.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你去见过她?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you go to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.09,1:09:01.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,见过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.79,1:09:03.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她跟你说些什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did she tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.40,1:09:07.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她告诉我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She told me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.97,1:09:10.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说了什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.90,1:09:15.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.51,1:09:17.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧 随我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.89,1:09:40.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 这位先知也就是发表...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So is this the same oracle that made...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.90,1:09:41.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,预言的那位?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the prophecy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.00,1:09:45.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 她已经很老了 从一开始她就同我们在一起了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. She's very old. She's been with us since the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.50,1:09:50.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么一开始? - 抵抗运动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The beginning? - Of the Resistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.04,1:09:53.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她知道些什么呢? 所有的事情?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she knows what? Everything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.41,1:09:58.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要是问她 她会说该知道的她都知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She would say she knows enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.51,1:10:00.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是说 她从来都不会错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she's never wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.48,1:10:05.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别拘泥于对或是错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try not to think of it in terms of right and wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.02,1:10:07.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她是个指路者 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is a guide, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.96,1:10:09.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她可以帮助你找到出路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can help you to find the path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.66,1:10:11.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她帮助过你吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She helped you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.65,1:10:13.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮助过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.06,1:10:15.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她告诉你了些什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did she tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.90,1:10:22.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她说我会找到救世主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I would find the One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.25,1:10:35.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过 我只能领你到门口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you I can only show you the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.05,1:10:38.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你得自己走进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to walk through it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.96,1:10:43.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.23,1:10:44.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你来的真准时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right on time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.83,1:10:56.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别客气 像在家里一样 莫费思 尼欧 你随我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make yourself at home, Morpheus. Neo, come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.28,1:11:03.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是另外一些候选人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are the other Potentials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.15,1:11:05.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请在这里稍等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.38,1:11:49.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要试图用蛮力去弯曲它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not try and bend the spoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.73,1:11:50.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是行不通的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.62,1:11:56.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要试着看清真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead, only try to realize the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.83,1:11:57.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么真相?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.62,1:12:00.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你手上原来没有汤匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no spoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.84,1:12:04.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,手上没有汤匙?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no spoon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.20,1:12:08.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样你就会看到 弯曲的不是汤匙 是你自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you'll see that it is not the spoon that bends. It is only yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.22,1:12:27.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先知现在请你去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Oracle will you see now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.30,1:12:38.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧 你来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.22,1:12:40.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be right with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.13,1:12:42.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是先知?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the Oracle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.05,1:12:43.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,答对了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bingo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.24,1:12:48.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和你想象的差太远了 是吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not quite what you were expecting, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.94,1:12:52.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.21,1:12:56.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,味道闻上去不错吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smell good, don't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.78,1:12:59.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.37,1:13:01.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就不请你坐了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd ask you to sit down...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.92,1:13:04.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,反正你也不会坐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but you're not going to anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.79,1:13:06.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,花瓶的事没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't worry about the vase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.86,1:13:07.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么花瓶?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What vase?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.29,1:13:11.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个花瓶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That vase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.46,1:13:13.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.73,1:13:16.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了 没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, don't worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.80,1:13:18.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会叫个孩子来修复的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get one of my kids to fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.30,1:13:20.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道这些的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.57,1:13:26.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让你觉得更困惑的是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's really going to bake your noodle later on is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.78,1:13:29.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我什么都不说 你是否还会打破花瓶?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...would you still have broken it if I hadn't said anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.52,1:13:36.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你挺机灵的 我没想到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're cuter than I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.46,1:13:41.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看出来了 为什么她喜欢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see why she likes you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.63,1:13:43.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.93,1:13:45.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看上去 还不够机灵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not too bright, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.18,1:13:51.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道莫费思为什么把你带来见我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know why Morpheus brought you to see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.39,1:13:55.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.56,1:13:57.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的想法呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.79,1:14:01.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为自己是救世主吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think you are the One?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.43,1:14:04.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说老实话 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.93,1:14:09.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道那是什么意思吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what that means?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.17,1:14:11.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是拉丁语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Latin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.71,1:14:13.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,意思就是"了解自己"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Means, "Know thyself."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.38,1:14:17.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我来告诉你一个小秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll let you in on a little secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.61,1:14:23.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当一个救世主就好比心里爱着一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Being the One is just like being in love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.08,1:14:27.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别人不能告诉你你恋爱了 只有你自己明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one can tell you you're in love. You just know it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.25,1:14:28.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,焦虑煎心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...through and through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.76,1:14:30.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,甜酸苦辣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balls to bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.33,1:14:34.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.10,1:14:38.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我好好看看你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'd better have a look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.53,1:14:41.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,张嘴 说"啊"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open your mouth. Say, "Ah."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.38,1:14:57.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样嘛...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.72,1:15:02.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来我要说的话就是:"哼 很有趣 不过..."{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm supposed to say, "Hmm, that's interesting, but..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.16,1:15:04.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,于是你会说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you say:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.16,1:15:06.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"不过什么? "{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.43,1:15:10.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过你已经知道我要告诉你什么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you already know what I'm going to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.83,1:15:12.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是救世主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not the One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.07,1:15:14.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,正是这话 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.57,1:15:18.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有天赋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the gift...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.37,1:15:21.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但看上去 你好像在等什么东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but it looks like you're waiting for something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.51,1:15:27.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.55,1:15:30.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的来生 也许是 谁知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your next life, maybe. Who knows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.02,1:15:33.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事情就是这样发展的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the way these things go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.15,1:15:35.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,笑什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's funny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.02,1:15:37.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,笑莫费思 他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.19,1:15:41.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我差点就相信他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He almost had me convinced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.16,1:15:43.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.90,1:15:46.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的莫费思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.34,1:15:52.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有他 我们早就走投无路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without him, we're lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.07,1:15:56.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是什么意思 "没有他"?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, "without him"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.15,1:16:02.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这事你也想知道?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure you want to hear this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.28,1:16:07.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思真的把你当成真的救世主 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus believes in you, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.82,1:16:11.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有任何人 包括你和我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no one, not you, not even me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.19,1:16:13.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以说服他选择其他人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...can convince him otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.83,1:16:16.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他为了这个盲目的信念{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He believes it so blindly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.50,1:16:20.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备奉献自己的生命来保护你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that he's going to sacrifice his life to save yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.07,1:16:21.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.10,1:16:25.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你将面临一个选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to have to make a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.71,1:16:29.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的一只手上 握着莫费思的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the one hand, you'll have Morpheus' life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.81,1:16:32.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,另一只手上 捏着你自己的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in the other hand, you'll have your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.08,1:16:36.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们当中的一个将做出牺牲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of you is going to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.45,1:16:41.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁呢? 就取决于你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which one will be up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.09,1:16:45.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 小伙子 我把事情说破了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, kiddo. I really am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.23,1:16:46.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有善良的灵魂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a good soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.06,1:16:50.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我实在不愿意把坏消息告诉给好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I hate giving good people bad news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.90,1:16:55.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过别担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.57,1:16:58.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as you step outside that door...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.27,1:17:00.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,心情就会好多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you'll start feeling better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.11,1:17:04.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要记住 你不应该相信什么狗屁命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll remember you don't believe in any of this fate crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.68,1:17:08.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的命运由你自己掌握{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in control of your own life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.28,1:17:10.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记住了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.06,1:17:13.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.32,1:17:16.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿块饼干{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...take a cookie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.46,1:17:20.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证 你在把这块饼干吃完之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise, by the time you're done eating it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.76,1:17:24.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,心情就会开朗起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you'll feel right as rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.27,1:17:34.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那番话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was said...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.24,1:17:36.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是对你说的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...was for you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.24,1:17:39.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它的对象只是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and for you alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.00,1:18:03.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们启程了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.20,1:18:34.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.78,1:18:50.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哇噢 难道我眼花了?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.72,1:18:54.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you just say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.06,1:18:56.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么 我说 我眼花了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.76,1:18:58.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看见什么了? - 什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you see? - What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.86,1:19:02.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一只黑猫打我们面前走过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A black cat went past us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.23,1:19:03.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后来 又有出现一只 一模一样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...then another just like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.06,1:19:05.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有多像? 还是同一只猫?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it the same cat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.87,1:19:07.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说不清楚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.64,1:19:09.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,苏薇琪 艾巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Switch, Apoc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.94,1:19:14.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.01,1:19:19.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当母体改变设置时 会产生脉冲 这就造成眼花现象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A vu is usually a glitch in the Matrix when they change something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.78,1:19:23.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.45,1:19:26.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.66,1:19:33.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们切断了主电缆 我们被包围了 赶快出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They cut the hard line. It's a trap! Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.33,1:19:40.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 糟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.54,1:20:23.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是他们改变的设置 我们成了笼中鸟 出不去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what they changed. We're trapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.24,1:20:25.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别慌 把你的电话给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be calm. Give me your phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.38,1:20:28.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一通话 他们就知道我们的所在 我们没别的选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll be able to track it. We have no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.02,1:20:31.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 接线员 - 坦克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Operator. - Tank{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.18,1:20:34.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找出这栋大楼的建筑图纸 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find a structural drawing of this building. Find it fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.63,1:20:45.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我找到了 - 我要找到主管线入口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Got it! - I need the main wet-wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.53,1:20:49.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在八楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eighth floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.10,1:20:50.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在八楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're on the eighth floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.00,1:20:52.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,苏薇琪 向前直走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Switch, straight ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.05,1:20:54.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neo{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.45,1:21:02.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但愿先知给过你什么好消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope the Oracle gave you some good news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.86,1:21:12.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就这里 向左 到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now left. That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.52,1:21:13.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.44,1:21:24.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们上哪儿了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.20,1:22:26.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在墙里面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in the walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.83,1:22:28.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在墙里面!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the walls!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.39,1:22:51.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是特警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an agent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.26,1:23:00.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.03,1:23:02.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要把尼欧带出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must get Neo out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.30,1:23:04.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,成败都靠他了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's all that matters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.50,1:23:05.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不! 莫费思 不能这样!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Morpheus! Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.91,1:23:06.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,崔妮蒂 走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trinity, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.61,1:23:08.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.25,1:23:17.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们不能扔下他! - 没有其它办法!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We can't leave him! - We have to!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.48,1:23:43.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.58,1:23:52.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伟大的莫费思 我们终于见面了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The great Morpheus. We meet at last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.65,1:23:54.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.32,1:23:55.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在下史密斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.69,1:23:57.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,特警史密斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.04,1:23:59.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说你们长得都一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all look the same to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.52,1:24:56.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把他带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.55,1:25:04.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.03,1:25:11.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 接线员 - 我需要出口 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Operator. - I need an exit, fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.09,1:25:13.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是塞佛? - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cypher? - Yeah{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.97,1:25:16.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出了意外 是车祸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was an accident. Goddamn car accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.14,1:25:19.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,忽然就发生了 轰的一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of a sudden, boom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.17,1:25:20.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那里好像还是有人要抓我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody up there still likes me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.87,1:25:22.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我找到你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.64,1:25:24.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快把我弄出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just get me out of here fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.81,1:25:27.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最近一个出口是 一个叫做"法兰克林和爱利"的电视修理铺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nearest exit, Franklin and Erie. An old TV repair shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.65,1:25:28.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.85,1:25:33.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 接线员 - 坦克 是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Operator. - Tank, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.82,1:25:35.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思还活着吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Morpheus alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.38,1:25:36.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思还活着吗 坦克?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Morpheus alive, Tank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.05,1:25:38.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,活着 正在移送过程中 目的地仍然不详{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. They're moving him. I don 't know where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.19,1:25:41.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他还活着 我们需要出口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's alive. We need an exit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.76,1:25:42.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们和塞佛相距不远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not far from Cypher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.93,1:25:44.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 塞佛? - 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cypher? - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.49,1:25:46.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我叫他去那家电视修理铺了 - 知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I sent him to Franklin and Erie. - Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.67,1:25:56.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接到他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.85,1:26:08.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.09,1:26:10.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在拨电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Making the call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.05,1:26:12.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.74,1:26:26.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你先走 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.77,1:26:30.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.72,1:26:41.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 铃声突然哑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. It just went dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.64,1:27:09.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.28,1:27:11.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,塞佛? 坦克在哪里?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cypher? Where's Tank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.19,1:27:18.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.96,1:27:22.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长久以来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for a long time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.26,1:27:26.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直以为我是爱你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I thought I was in love with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.00,1:27:29.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,连梦里都在想你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to dream about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.13,1:27:32.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个漂亮的女人 崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a beautiful woman, Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.10,1:27:35.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在事情弄到这个样子 实在太不幸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too bad things had to turn out this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.21,1:27:37.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把他们都杀了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.54,1:27:39.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么? - 天哪!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.28,1:27:40.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我厌倦了 崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm tired, Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.14,1:27:43.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我厌倦了这种战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm tired of this war...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.28,1:27:47.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌战斗 还有这该死的战舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...tired of fighting. I'm tired of this ship...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.45,1:27:52.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天天挨冻 吃那些难以下咽的浆糊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of being cold, of eating the same goddamn goop every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.46,1:27:55.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我最受不了的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But most of all...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.03,1:27:59.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个无所不晓的大博士和他的胡言乱语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm tired of that jackoff and all of his bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.53,1:28:01.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吓你一跳了吧 蠢蛋!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surprise, asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.33,1:28:06.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你做梦也没想到会有今天吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet you never saw this coming... ...did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.17,1:28:10.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老天啊 但愿我也能在那里...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I wish I could be there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.11,1:28:12.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看着他们将你打个粉碎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when they break you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.68,1:28:16.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我太想去看你的下场了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could walk in just when it happens...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.55,1:28:19.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是呀 我去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so right then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.45,1:28:21.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你就知道原来是我干的好事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you'd know it was me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.55,1:28:23.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你出卖了莫费思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave them Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.07,1:28:24.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他骗了我们 崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He lied to us, Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.79,1:28:26.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们被他耍了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tricked us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.82,1:28:28.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你告诉我们事实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you had told us the truth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.09,1:28:31.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那颗红色药丸我当场就会塞进你的屁股里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we would've told you to shove that red pill up your ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.19,1:28:34.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的不对 塞佛 他给了我们自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is not true, Cypher. He set us free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.60,1:28:35.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"自由"...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Free."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.77,1:28:37.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把这叫做"自由"?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call this free?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.90,1:28:42.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我所有的行动都得听他吩咐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I do is what he tells me to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.01,1:28:46.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你要我在这里和母体作个选择的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had to choose between that and the Matrix...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.04,1:28:49.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我选母体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I choose the Matrix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.51,1:28:51.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,母体是个虚幻的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Matrix isn't real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.45,1:28:52.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不对 崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I disagree, Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.12,1:28:55.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为 母体...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the Matrix...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.72,1:28:58.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比这个世界要更真实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...can be more real than this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.46,1:29:02.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在要做的就是拔掉这里的插孔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I do is pull the plug here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.53,1:29:04.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.09,1:29:07.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就得眼睁睁地看着他去死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you have to watch Apoc die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.03,1:29:10.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trinity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.17,1:29:16.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真实世界欢迎你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the real world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.21,1:29:18.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你已经离开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.27,1:29:20.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 回不去了 - 这只是你的认为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can 't go back. - That's what you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.01,1:29:22.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会重新复原我的身体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll reinsert my body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.78,1:29:26.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我睡一觉 等我醒来的时候 我就什么都不记得了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I go back to sleep. When I wake up, I won 't remember a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.93,1:29:30.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 等等 如果你有什么重要的话要告诉苏薇琪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way... ...if you have anything important to say to Switch...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.29,1:29:32.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我建议你现在就说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...say it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.66,1:29:33.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 你不能这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, please don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.12,1:29:35.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想这样死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.43,1:29:39.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不想这样死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.53,1:29:44.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不说 活该{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.06,1:29:46.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你鬼迷心窍了 塞佛!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn you, Cypher!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.00,1:29:48.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要恨我 崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hate me, Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.24,1:29:51.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是一个信使{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just a messenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.50,1:29:54.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我就证明给你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And right now, I'm going to prove it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.81,1:29:57.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果莫费思是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Morpheus was right...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.04,1:29:59.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个插孔我就该拔不出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there's no way I can pull this plug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.48,1:30:01.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果尼欧是救世主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Neo 's the One...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.45,1:30:04.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么这里一定有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...then there'd have to be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.52,1:30:07.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,某种神奇的力量出来阻止我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...some kind of a miracle to stop me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.65,1:30:08.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.19,1:30:11.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思就是 如果他死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, how can he be the One...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.56,1:30:12.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么成得了救世主呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if he's dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.89,1:30:16.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到现在也不肯回答我的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never did answer me before...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.40,1:30:18.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思的一派胡言你到底信还是不信?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if you bought into Morpheus ' bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.13,1:30:22.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说呀 我只要你一个字:"是"或者"不是"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. All I want is a little yes or no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.67,1:30:26.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看着他的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look into his eyes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.74,1:30:29.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那双漂亮的大眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...those big, pretty eyes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.01,1:30:32.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后回答我的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and tell me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.08,1:30:34.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"是"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...yes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.68,1:30:36.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是"不是"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.32,1:30:38.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.45,1:30:39.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.29,1:30:40.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.59,1:30:46.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,信也好 不信也好 你这个浑蛋 来尝尝烧烤的滋味吧!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe it or not, you piece of shit, you're still going to burn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.11,1:31:06.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你先走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.29,1:31:15.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你受伤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.45,1:31:16.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事 会好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.33,1:31:20.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,道瑟呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dozer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.71,1:31:41.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你曾经站在这里 领略过窗外的景色吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever stood and stared at it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.05,1:31:45.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,惊叹于它的完美和...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marveled at its beauty...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.52,1:31:47.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,造物主的天才呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...its genius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.99,1:31:50.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,芸芸众生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billions of people...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.09,1:31:53.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为她生 为她死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...just living out their lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.89,1:31:56.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无悔无怨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oblivious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.13,1:32:04.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 第一个母体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know that the first Matrix...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.27,1:32:08.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是得到完美设计的 人类不会经受磨难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...was designed to be a perfect human world where none suffered...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.44,1:32:12.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人人安居乐业{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where everyone would be happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.91,1:32:14.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是它是一个灾难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a disaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.61,1:32:19.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人习惯这种生活 整批人都死亡了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one would accept the program. Entire crops were lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.82,1:32:21.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一些人认为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some believe that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.82,1:32:26.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的程序语言没有能够 详细描述你们的完美世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we lacked the programming language to describe your perfect world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.46,1:32:28.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我认为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I believe that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.46,1:32:29.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人类这种生命体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as a species...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.63,1:32:33.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有吃得苦中苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...human beings define their reality through misery...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.70,1:32:35.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,方才识得真中真{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.33,1:32:38.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你那完美的世界只是一个噩梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the perfect world was a dream...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.27,1:32:43.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们人类不断想要从中惊醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that your primitive cerebrum kept trying to wake up from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.41,1:32:48.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为此 母体针对这一情况又作了重新设计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why the Matrix was redesigned to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.58,1:32:50.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以符合你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The peak...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.32,1:32:51.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,文明的特征{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of your civilization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.98,1:32:54.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我之所以说是"你的文明"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say, "your civilization"...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.52,1:32:58.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为一旦是我们为你量身定做 它就变成了我们的文明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because when we started thinking for you, it became our civilization...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.89,1:33:02.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们当然要仔细掂量 这究竟是什么东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which is, of course, what this is all about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.33,1:33:05.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是演化 莫费思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evolution, Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.23,1:33:07.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,演化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.77,1:33:11.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像恐龙灭亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the dinosaur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.81,1:33:15.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看着窗外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out that window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.24,1:33:18.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人类曾有辉煌岁月{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.04,1:33:22.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是未来属于我们的 莫费思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future is our world, Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.32,1:33:25.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是未来的主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future is our time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.92,1:33:31.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有情况 可能对我们不利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There could be a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.06,1:33:35.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们对他做了什么手脚 - 他们强行切入了他的思路{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are they doing to him? - They're breaking into his mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.39,1:33:37.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这情形有点像黑客程序 剩下的就是时间问题了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like hacking a computer. All it takes is time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.06,1:33:39.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要多久?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.53,1:33:42.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,由思路而定 不过最终 它要瘫痪...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Depends on the mind. But eventually, it'll crack...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.87,1:33:47.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的α图形将从这样转换成这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and his alpha patterns will change from this to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.57,1:33:50.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果转换完成 他就会对他们有问必答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When it does, he'll tell them anything they want to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.74,1:33:51.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们想干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do they want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.11,1:33:56.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每艘战舰舰长进入锡安主机的登录密码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The leader of every ship is given codes to Zion's mainframe computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.43,1:33:59.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有了登录密码 他们就可进入锡安主机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If an agent got the codes and got into Zion's mainframe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.49,1:34:02.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从而摧毁我们 我们不能让他们得逞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they could destroy us. We can't let that happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.87,1:34:06.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,崔妮蒂 锡安的重要性超过我 超过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zion's more important than me... ...or you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.56,1:34:07.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至莫费思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or even Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.63,1:34:13.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办 我们应该有办法的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There has to be something we can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.78,1:34:16.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有的 把他的插孔拔掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is. We pull the plug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.80,1:34:20.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样你不就是杀了他了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to kill him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.77,1:34:21.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是在杀莫费思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill Morpheus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.54,1:34:24.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有别的选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.43,1:34:34.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要让人去做机器的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never send a human to do a machine's job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.22,1:34:35.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果大脑被控制{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the insider has failed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.22,1:34:39.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就会立即充当内应 除非...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they'll sever the connection as soon as possible, unless...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.66,1:34:41.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们死了 无论哪种情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're dead. In either case...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.59,1:34:45.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有选择 按计划继续做下去 把乌贼派出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have no choice. Continue as planned. Deploy the sentinels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.40,1:34:46.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,立刻行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.70,1:34:54.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思 你不仅是我们的舰长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus, you were more than a leader to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.37,1:34:57.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,更像是我们的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were a father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.11,1:35:01.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们永远怀念你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll miss you always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.73,1:35:09.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,住手!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.36,1:35:11.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不信我们非得这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe this is happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.82,1:35:13.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 尼欧 不这么做就来不及了 - 会吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Neo, this has to be done. - Does it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.66,1:35:16.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.40,1:35:18.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不会是一种巧合 不可能的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can't be just coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.20,1:35:18.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.50,1:35:20.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想到先知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Oracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.57,1:35:22.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她告诉我这件事会发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She told me this would happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.77,1:35:26.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她说 这事该由我作出选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She told me that I would have to make a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.41,1:35:28.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么选择?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.64,1:35:32.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.91,1:35:34.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.41,1:35:35.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 不能去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.11,1:35:36.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,必须去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.02,1:35:40.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧 莫费思牺牲自己 就是为了让我们把你带出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neo, Morpheus sacrificed himself so that we could get you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.85,1:35:42.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能再进去呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no way that you're going back in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.39,1:35:46.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思这么做 是因为他相信我是救世主 但谁知我却不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus did what he did because he believed I'm something I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.53,1:35:49.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.90,1:35:51.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是救世主 崔妮蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not the One, Trinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.33,1:35:55.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 先知对我说过了 - 不对 你绝对是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Oracle hit me with that too. - No, you have to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.13,1:35:57.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我不是 我不过是另一个普通人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I'm not. I'm just another guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.40,1:35:59.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 尼欧 那不是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Neo, that's not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.31,1:36:01.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't be true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.58,1:36:03.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.31,1:36:10.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧 你疯了 他们把莫费思关押在有重兵把守的大楼里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is loco. They've got Morpheus in a military-controlled building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.88,1:36:15.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,即使你冲进去了 还有三个特警在看守他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if you somehow got inside, those are agents holding him. Three of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.59,1:36:20.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也想莫费思回来 但你的行为是自杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want Morpheus back too, but what you're talking about is suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.69,1:36:22.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道表面上我的行为是像自杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what it looks like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.80,1:36:26.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实并非如此 但我无法向你解释清楚这一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but it's not. I can't explain to you why it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.30,1:36:31.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫斐斯有个信念 愿意为此付出生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus believed something, and he was ready to give his life for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.27,1:36:34.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我明白过来了 所以我必须去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand that now. That's why I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.47,1:36:35.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,究竟为什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.51,1:36:37.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我也有信念了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I believe in something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.24,1:36:38.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.51,1:36:41.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信我能救回莫费思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe I can bring him back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.26,1:37:00.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要干什么? - 跟你一齐去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - Going with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.43,1:37:01.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.57,1:37:02.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不能去?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"No"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.60,1:37:05.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难道我不能有我的信念?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you what I believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.24,1:37:08.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信 莫费思对我远比他对你更重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus means more to me than he does to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.94,1:37:13.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信 如果你真的要舍身救他 那你就一定需要我的协助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe if you are serious about saving him, you will need my help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.45,1:37:15.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我是舰上的负责人之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And since I am the ranking officer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.78,1:37:18.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不让我去 我认为你不会成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if you don't like it, I believe you can go to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.42,1:37:21.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有我 你哪都别想去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you aren't going anywhere else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.29,1:37:23.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坦克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tank...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.89,1:37:25.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,送我们进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Ioad us up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.67,1:37:38.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我在母体内时 我获得了一个启示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to share a revelation that I've had...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.37,1:37:40.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想同你分享{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...during my time here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.24,1:37:44.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在试图把你这种生命体作一个分类的时候 启示来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It came to me when I tried to classify your species...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.48,1:37:46.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I realized...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.95,1:37:49.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你其实不是哺乳动物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that you're not actually mammals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.45,1:37:53.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这个星球上的每一种哺乳动物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every mammal on this planet...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.32,1:37:59.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都有一种适应环境变化 取得平衡的演化本能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...instinctively develops an equilibrium with the surrounding environment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.39,1:38:01.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你们人却没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you humans do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.83,1:38:05.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们找到一个地方 然后就繁殖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You move to an area and you multiply...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.63,1:38:10.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,繁殖、繁殖 直到所有的自然资源都被用尽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and multiply until every natural resource is consumed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.44,1:38:12.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要想生存 唯一的办法就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only way you can survive...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.77,1:38:15.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,扩散出去 侵占另一块地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is to spread to another area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.18,1:38:24.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个星球上还有一种生命体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is another organism on this planet...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.32,1:38:26.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,生存方式同你们相像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that follows the same pattern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.92,1:38:28.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想知道是什么吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what it is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.99,1:38:30.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,病毒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.09,1:38:35.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人类是一种疾病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Human beings are a disease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.56,1:38:37.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个星球的癌症{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cancer of this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.36,1:38:39.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一场瘟疫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a plague.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.19,1:38:41.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,消灭你们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.60,1:38:43.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就只有我们这些人工智能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...are the cure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.97,1:38:45.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 要什么尽管说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so what do you need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.04,1:38:47.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了奇迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides a miracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.74,1:38:51.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,枪支弹药 越多越好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guns. Lots of guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.82,1:39:01.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neo{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.74,1:39:05.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人敢做这种尝试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one has ever done anything like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.59,1:39:09.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以才会成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why it's going to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.60,1:39:15.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么针剂不起作用?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why isn't the serum working?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.13,1:39:18.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大概问题问错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps we're asking the wrong questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.54,1:39:21.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave me with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.38,1:39:25.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.69,1:39:38.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住 莫费思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.49,1:39:41.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们来救你了 他们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming for you. They're coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.63,1:39:45.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听得见我的话吗 莫费思?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you hear me, Morpheus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.00,1:39:48.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要同你促膝谈心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to be honest...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.03,1:39:50.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,掏掏心里话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.64,1:39:56.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.11,1:39:58.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...hate...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.28,1:40:00.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this place...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.65,1:40:02.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这座动物园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this zoo...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.18,1:40:04.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这座监狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this prison...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.52,1:40:07.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这种现实 你爱怎么叫它都行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this reality, whatever you want to call it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.95,1:40:10.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我实在对它忍无可忍了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't stand it any longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.02,1:40:12.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它是一股臭气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.23,1:40:16.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果可以这样形容的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there is such a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.50,1:40:19.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我已经被它饱和了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel saturated by it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.23,1:40:22.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能够...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.83,1:40:23.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闻到...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...taste...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.54,1:40:26.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你那污浊的味道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...your stink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.81,1:40:30.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每次闻到这种味道 我都怕被传染上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every time I do, I fear that I have somehow been infected by it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.78,1:40:31.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多么的恶心啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's repulsive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.58,1:40:34.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不对?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.18,1:40:38.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.85,1:40:41.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要逃出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must get free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.32,1:40:44.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙就在这个脑袋里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in this mind is the key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.49,1:40:46.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的钥匙!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.32,1:40:49.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要将锡安摧毁 我就没有必要在这里了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once Zion is destroyed, there is no need for me to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.49,1:40:51.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你懂吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.36,1:40:52.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要登录密码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need the codes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.06,1:40:55.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须打进锡安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to get inside Zion...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.70,1:40:58.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须告诉我如何进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you have to tell me how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.60,1:41:00.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 你说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to tell me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.74,1:41:02.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不说 死路一条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or you're going to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.39,1:41:25.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把你随身带着的金属器物都拿出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please remove any metallic items you're carrying. Keys, loose change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.76,1:41:27.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙、硬币...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keys,changes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.57,1:41:31.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.32,1:41:44.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请求增援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Backup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.42,1:41:46.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,立即增援{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send backup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.04,1:42:10.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不许动!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.04,1:44:27.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是干嘛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.85,1:44:30.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.35,1:44:31.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.98,1:45:02.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他们要来救他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they're trying to save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.30,1:45:19.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"手上没有汤匙"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no spoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.66,1:45:50.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找到他们 全部杀掉!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find them and destroy them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.46,1:45:55.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,重复一遍 我们遭到攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're under attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.93,1:46:26.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,崔妮蒂!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trinity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.49,1:46:29.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.19,1:46:52.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过是个人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.37,1:46:54.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看你怎么躲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dodge this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.55,1:47:09.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你那手哪学的? - 哪一手?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How did you do that? - Do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.45,1:47:13.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟他们一样会躲子弹 我没还见过谁有那么快的速度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You moved like they do. I've never seen anyone move that fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.49,1:47:15.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在还不够快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't fast enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.60,1:47:19.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会开那东西吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you fly that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.23,1:47:22.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没学过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.50,1:47:26.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接线员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Operator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.54,1:47:29.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坦克 我需要飞行程序 驾驶B-212直升机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a pilot program for a B-212 helicopter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.24,1:47:31.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.45,1:47:41.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.20,1:47:57.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.85,1:48:50.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思 站起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus, get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.66,1:48:51.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,站起来 站起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up, get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.49,1:49:30.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他跳不过来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not going to make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.74,1:49:40.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓到你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.90,1:50:48.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,崔妮蒂!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trinity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.28,1:51:31.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.52,1:51:33.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是救世主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.47,1:51:51.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你相信了吗 崔妮蒂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe it now, Trinity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.35,1:51:55.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,莫费思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morpheus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.68,1:51:58.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那位先知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Oracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.78,1:52:02.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 她告诉我 - 她把你该听的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She told me... - She told you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.55,1:52:04.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全告诉你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what you needed to hear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.42,1:52:05.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一句废话也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.78,1:52:09.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧 你迟早会认识到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sooner or later you'll realize, just as I did...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.09,1:52:12.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,认识未来是一回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there's a difference between knowing the path...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.12,1:52:14.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而走向未来又是一回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and walking the path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.43,1:52:18.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 接线员 - 坦克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Operator. - Tank{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.60,1:52:22.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 天哪 终于听到你的声音了 - 我们需要出口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's good to hear your voice. - We need an exit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.40,1:52:26.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经准备好了 在地铁站 站名"斯带巴博"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got one ready. Subway station, State and Balboa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.21,1:52:39.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.38,1:52:40.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,追踪已经完成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trace was completed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.89,1:52:41.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道他们现在何处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have their position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.25,1:52:44.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乌贼待命出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sentinels are standing by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.22,1:52:47.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,命令攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Order the strike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.23,1:52:56.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们还没出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not out yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.38,1:53:08.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你先走 莫费思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You first, Morpheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.43,1:53:31.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧 我有话要对你说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neo, I want to tell you something...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.97,1:53:38.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我又怕说出来会有不好的结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I'm afraid of what it could mean if I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.55,1:53:45.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先知对我说的话已经全部成为事实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything the Oracle told me has come true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.62,1:53:50.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是除了这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything but this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.86,1:53:52.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪件事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.08,1:54:18.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neo{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.02,1:54:20.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么会这样? - 坏在一个特警手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? - An agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.89,1:54:21.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须再把我送出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send me back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.95,1:54:22.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.85,1:54:26.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.96,1:54:30.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑 尼欧 快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run, Neo. Run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.70,1:54:37.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他要干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is he doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.57,1:54:38.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他开始觉悟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's beginning to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.85,1:55:07.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没子弹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.73,1:55:09.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So are you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.23,1:55:45.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我将乐呵呵地看着你死去...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to enjoy watching you die...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.30,1:55:47.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.35,1:56:30.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝啊 他会杀死他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, he's killing him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.60,1:57:58.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听见了吗 安德森先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear that, Mr. Anderson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.47,1:58:02.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这声音预示着你在劫难逃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the sound of inevitability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.11,1:58:08.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这声音就是你的丧钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the sound of your death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.35,1:58:11.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.88,1:58:13.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.52,1:58:18.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.86,1:58:53.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么啦? - 不知道 无法定位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? - I don't know. I lost him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.48,1:58:55.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(警告：异物逼近)
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.56,1:58:56.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 啐!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.01,1:59:10.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,乌贼来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sentinels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.21,1:59:13.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还有多远? - 还有五、六分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long? - Five, maybe six minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.48,1:59:17.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坦克 给 EMP 充电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tank, charge the EMP.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.88,1:59:20.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他还没出来 我们不能用 - 我知道的 崔妮蒂 别担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We can't use that until he's out. - I know. Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.32,1:59:23.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他能够出来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.42,1:59:25.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要平底鞋还是舞鞋? 不是 就是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flat or pumps? No, just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.59,1:59:28.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我见鬼了? 那是我的手机!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the shit? That's my phone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.89,1:59:30.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个人抢走了我的手机!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That guy took my phone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.86,1:59:33.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找到他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.93,1:59:35.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他正在跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on the run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.37,1:59:36.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,博士先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Wizard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.67,1:59:38.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快把我接出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...get me out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.27,1:59:40.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有个老出口：华伯和雷克街{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got an old exit. Wabash and Lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.24,1:59:45.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.70,2:00:08.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,路在哪里? 快说啊!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Need a little help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.30,2:00:11.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,进门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.55,2:00:29.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走左手边的门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The door on your left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.92,2:00:31.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,错了 这是右边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your other left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.90,2:00:39.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走后门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The back door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.64,2:00:59.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(红色警告)
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.88,2:01:01.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.72,2:01:04.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们已经到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here they come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.02,2:01:34.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一定出得来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going to make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.46,2:01:47.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,胡同底有座救生梯 接303室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fire escape at the end of the alley, room 303.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.76,2:02:21.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(警告：舰壳破坏)
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.93,2:02:23.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们已经进来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.30,2:02:27.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快 尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry, Neo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.62,2:03:24.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.30,2:03:33.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看死了没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.74,2:03:39.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.98,2:03:48.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见 安德森先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Mr. Anderson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.11,2:03:57.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尼欧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neo{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.46,2:04:00.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经不再害怕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not afraid anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.07,2:04:07.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先知告诉我 我会爱上谁 那个我爱上的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Oracle told me...I'd fall in love, and that the man I loved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.34,2:04:09.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是救世主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would be the One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.14,2:04:14.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你知道吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.78,2:04:16.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you can't be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.35,2:04:20.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.75,2:04:23.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.79,2:04:27.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听见了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.56,2:04:30.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.22,2:04:55.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 起来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.29,2:05:05.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.06,2:05:32.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.79,2:05:34.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是救世主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is the One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.30,2:08:00.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们在那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.24,2:08:03.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉得到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can feel you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.51,2:08:05.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们害怕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that you're afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.54,2:08:07.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们害怕我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're afraid of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:07.48,2:08:09.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们害怕改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're afraid of change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.48,2:08:12.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,〖 系统崩溃 〗 我不知道将来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don 't know the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.25,2:08:14.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我来这里 不是告诉你们 一切将怎么结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn 't come here to tell you how this is going to end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.12,2:08:18.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是来告诉你们 一切将怎么开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came here to tell you how it's going to begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:18.99,2:08:20.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要挂电话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll hang up this phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.79,2:08:23.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你们瞒着人类的事实大白天下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I'll show these people what you don 't want them to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.23,2:08:26.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让芸芸众生见到真实世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to show them a world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.26,2:08:28.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个没有电脑的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.33,2:08:32.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有硬性规定和任何界线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A world without rules and controls, without borders or boundaries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.24,2:08:35.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个充满可能性的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A world where anything is possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.58,2:08:39.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,实现了这样的世界之后 我们再奔向何处?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where we go from there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.18,2:08:42.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我把这个选择留给你们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is a choice I leave to you.{\r}
